 "About Me": "关于我",
 "I am a second-year student at the <strong>University of Toronto</strong>, working toward a <strong>Bachelor of Applied Science in Mechanical Engineering</strong>. My program includes a <strong>Professional Experience Year</strong>, a twelve to sixteen month co-operative placement in industry that I will complete starting May 2028 after my third year of classes. In addition to my major, I am triple minoring in <strong>Mechatronics and Robotics</strong>, <strong>Business</strong>, and <strong>Advanced Manufacturing</strong>.": "我是<strong>多伦多大学</strong>的二年级学生，正在攻读<strong>机械工程应用科学学士学位</strong>。我的培养计划包含一个<strong>专业实习年</strong>，即在业界进行为期十二至十六个月的带薪实习，我将在完成大三课程后于 2028 年 5 月开始。除主修专业外，我还同时辅修<strong>机电一体化与机器人</strong>、<strong>商科</strong>和<strong>先进制造</strong>三个方向。",
 "I have a wide range of expertise, from project management and consulting to engineering analysis and design. On the leadership side, I serve as <strong>President of the University of Toronto Wind Turbine Design Team</strong> and as one of three <strong>Vice Presidents of Competitions for the 2028 Ontario Engineering Competition</strong>. I have also worked as a <strong>consultant for two student consulting groups</strong>, delivering semester-long engagements for real clients.": "我的专长涵盖面很广，从项目管理与咨询，到工程分析与设计。在领导力方面，我担任<strong>多伦多大学风力涡轮机设计团队主席</strong>，同时是<strong>2028 年安大略工程竞赛的竞赛副主席</strong>（共三位）之一。我还曾担任<strong>两个学生咨询组织的顾问</strong>，为真实客户完成为期一学期的咨询项目。",
 "Alongside my leadership experience, I have extensive experience using <strong>SolidWorks and Autodesk Fusion</strong> for computer-aided design, <strong>ANSYS</strong> for computational fluid dynamics and finite element analysis, and <strong>Python, MATLAB, JavaScript and embedded C</strong> for optimizing workflows and software development. I also work as an <strong>Undergraduate Researcher at the Hub for Advancing Buildings</strong>, developing methods to improve buildings. One unique project I worked on recently was training <strong>reinforcement learning agents</strong> to optimize the cooling operations in IT facilities on a high-performance computing cluster!": "除了领导经历，我在以下方面也有丰富经验：使用 <strong>SolidWorks 和 Autodesk Fusion</strong> 进行计算机辅助设计，使用 <strong>ANSYS</strong> 进行计算流体力学和有限元分析，以及使用 <strong>Python、MATLAB、JavaScript 和嵌入式 C</strong> 优化工作流程和开发软件。我还担任<strong>建筑创新中心（Hub for Advancing Buildings）本科研究员</strong>，致力于开发改善建筑性能的方法。我最近参与的一个特别项目，是在高性能计算集群上训练<strong>强化学习智能体</strong>，以优化 IT 设施的制冷运行！",
 "Before university, I ran <strong>SnowScape Landscaping</strong>, a business I started at fourteen and grew to <strong>more than one hundred clients</strong> and <strong>a crew of ten</strong>. Quoting jobs, scheduling crews and keeping customers happy taught me more about working with people than any course has, and it is where the business half of my interest started. Outside of school, you will usually find me on a hockey rink, out on a trail, or somewhere in the middle of a run. I speak <strong>English and Mandarin</strong> natively and can hold a conversation in <strong>German</strong>.": "上大学之前，我经营着 <strong>SnowScape 园林绿化</strong>，这是我十四岁时创办的公司，后来发展到拥有<strong>一百多位客户</strong>和<strong>十人团队</strong>。报价、安排团队排班、让客户满意，这些经历教会我的与人合作之道比任何课程都多，也正是我对商业产生兴趣的起点。课余时间，你通常会在冰球场上、登山步道上，或者某次跑步途中找到我。我的母语是<strong>英语和普通话</strong>，并能用<strong>德语</strong>进行日常交流。",
