 "With the University of Toronto Wind Turbine Design Team (UTWind), I contributed to the mechanical design, fabrication, and final assembly of a custom six-foot vertical-axis wind turbine, from component CAD and structural analysis through machining and integration. In July 2026, I was one of eleven members who travelled to the Netherlands to present the turbine and compete at the International Small Wind Turbine Competition, hosted by TU Delft and Hanze University. During wind-tunnel characterisation, the rotor achieved a cut-in speed of 4 m/s, the threshold at which it begins delivering usable electrical power.": "在多伦多大学风力涡轮机设计团队（UTWind），我参与了一台定制的六英尺垂直轴风力涡轮机的机械设计、制造和总装，从零部件 CAD 和结构分析，到机加工与集成。2026 年 7 月，我作为十一名成员之一前往荷兰，展示这台涡轮机并参加由代尔夫特理工大学和汉斯应用科技大学主办的国际小型风力涡轮机竞赛。在风洞特性测试中，转子实现了 4 m/s 的切入风速，即开始输出可用电能的临界风速。",
