 "Motorized Cross-Country Ski-Assist Device": "电动越野滑雪助推装置",
 "This is a powered propulsion attachment for children's cross-country skis, developed by a six-person team for an external client in <strong>Engineering Strategies and Practice 2 (APS112)</strong>, a first-year design course at the University of Toronto. The client's need was straightforward: young skiers fatigue quickly on family outings and cannot maintain their parents' pace. We bounded the problem to groomed trails and ambient temperatures down to -20 degrees Celsius, generated eighty candidate concepts, and converged through a feasibility screen, multi-voting, and graphical decision matrices, with a weighted Pugh matrix selecting the final concept.": "这是一款为儿童越野滑雪板设计的动力推进附件，由一个六人团队在多伦多大学一年级设计课程<strong>工程策略与实践 2（APS112）</strong>中为外部客户开发。客户的需求很明确：小滑雪者在家庭出游时很快就会疲劳，跟不上父母的速度。我们把问题范围限定在压实的雪道和低至 -20 摄氏度的环境温度，提出了八十个候选概念，并通过可行性筛选、多轮投票和图形化决策矩阵逐步收敛，最终由加权 Pugh 矩阵选出方案。",
 "I produced the CAD models and dimensioned manufacturing drawings for two of the three shortlisted concepts, working in both <strong>Autodesk Fusion and SolidWorks</strong>. The first was a <strong>belt-driven traction attachment</strong>, in which a rear motor hub drives a sprocket pair and a continuous tread along the underside of the ski to increase tractive effort on packed snow. The second was a <strong>motorised paddle-wheel unit</strong>, in which a brushless DC motor drives sprocket-profile rotors that generate thrust against the snow surface. It mounts with adjustable suction cups, accommodating youth skis from 110 cm to 170 cm with no permanent modification. Both designs fully enclose their moving parts to satisfy the toy-safety and IP66 ingress-protection requirements we specified for users as young as three, and the paddle wheel ranked highest in the final Pugh matrix.": "我使用 <strong>Autodesk Fusion 和 SolidWorks</strong>，为三个入围概念中的两个制作了 CAD 模型和标注尺寸的制造图纸。第一个是<strong>皮带驱动牵引附件</strong>：后置电机轮毂驱动一对链轮和沿滑雪板底部的连续履带，以增加在压实雪面上的牵引力。第二个是<strong>电动桨轮单元</strong>：无刷直流电机驱动链轮齿形转子，对雪面产生推力。它通过可调吸盘安装，适配 110 cm 至 170 cm 的青少年滑雪板，无需任何永久改装。两种设计都将运动部件完全封闭，以满足我们为三岁以上用户制定的玩具安全和 IP66 防护等级要求；桨轮方案在最终的 Pugh 矩阵中排名第一。",
