 "BEIE Lab": "BEIE 实验室",
 "For the Building Energy and Indoor Environment (BEIE) Lab at the University of Toronto, I developed a custom Fitbit OS clock face and phone companion application in JavaScript, SVG, and CSS. It administers scheduled and on-demand ecological momentary assessment surveys to more than twenty participants in a multi-summer residential heat-exposure study, then transmits each response through a Bluetooth and REST data pipeline into a cloud store, from which the research team exports an analysis-ready CSV dataset.": "我为多伦多大学建筑能源与室内环境（BEIE）实验室，用 JavaScript、SVG 和 CSS 开发了一款定制的 Fitbit OS 表盘及手机配套应用。它为一项持续多个夏季的住宅高温暴露研究中的二十多名参与者，按计划或按需推送生态瞬时评估（EMA）问卷，并通过蓝牙和 REST 数据管道将每条回答传送到云端存储，研究团队再从中导出可直接分析的 CSV 数据集。",
