 "Calgary Food Bank: CANstruction 2025": "卡尔加里食物银行：CANstruction 2025",
 "For the 2025 Calgary Food Bank CANstruction event, our team designed and erected a large-scale structural sculpture composed entirely of donated canned goods. Working alongside professional engineers from Fluor, we applied load-path and stability analysis to maximise the structure's height within the compressive limits of the cans and the constraints of an unfastened, dry-stacked assembly. Every can was donated to the food bank after the competition.": "在 2025 年卡尔加里食物银行 CANstruction 活动中，我们团队设计并搭建了一座完全由捐赠罐头组成的大型结构雕塑。我们与 Fluor 公司的专业工程师合作，运用荷载路径和稳定性分析，在罐头的抗压极限以及无固定、干垒装配的约束下，尽可能提高结构高度。比赛结束后，所有罐头都捐给了食物银行。",
