 "My first CANstruction was in 2024, designing and constructing a canned-food sculpture for the Calgary Food Bank under genuine structural constraints. It was my first applied experience with load distribution, centre-of-mass control, and stability analysis, working on a team that included practising structural engineers.": "我的第一次 CANstruction 是在 2024 年，在真实的结构约束下为卡尔加里食物银行设计并搭建罐头雕塑。这是我第一次实际运用荷载分布、重心控制和稳定性分析，团队中还有执业结构工程师。",
