 "What I Do<br>For Fun": "我的<br>业余爱好",
 "The best engineers I know are well-rounded people. Here is what I love to do when I'm not studying or building something.": "我认识的最优秀的工程师都是全面发展的人。以下是我不学习、不做东西时最喜欢做的事。",
 "Skiing": "滑雪",
 "I grew up skiing in Banff, and nothing beats a powder day in the Rockies. Ski touring the Alps is on the list.": "我从小在班夫滑雪，没有什么比落基山脉的粉雪日更棒了。去阿尔卑斯山滑雪旅行已经列入我的愿望清单。",
 "Hiking": "徒步",
 "Just like skiing, most of my best hikes have been in Banff, the kind of trails where you're too tired to think about anything else. A good way to reset between school terms.": "和滑雪一样，我最棒的徒步经历大多在班夫，那种累到脑子里什么都不想的山路。这是学期之间放空自己的好方法。",
 "Golf": "高尔夫",
 "I picked up golf during my senior year of high school and have been itching to play ever since. I'm always up for a casual round with friends or family when the weather's good. Still working on keeping it out of the trees.": "我在高中最后一年开始打高尔夫，从那以后就一直心痒想打。天气好的时候，我随时乐意和朋友或家人轻松打一场。至于怎么不把球打进树林，我还在练习中。",
 "My go-to way to clear my head and think about new ideas. No goal in particular, I just love running, especially downtown along the coast of Lake Ontario.": "这是我清空思绪、思考新想法的首选方式。没有特定目标，我就是喜欢跑步，尤其是在市中心沿着安大略湖畔跑。",
 "Spain": "西班牙",
 "Germany": "德国",
 "Czechia": "捷克",
 "Travelling": "旅行",
 "I travel to see how things are built. The engineering, the history, and the different ways people have solved the same problem is always fascinating. Every city has its own answer to how infrastructure, technology, and public life should work, and it's hard not to notice that once you start looking. The food is always a plus as well!": "我旅行是为了看看事物是如何建造的。工程、历史，以及人们用不同方式解决同一个问题，总是令人着迷。每座城市对基础设施、技术和公共生活应该如何运作都有自己的答案，一旦开始留意，就很难视而不见。当然，美食也总是一大亮点！",
