 "Hockey": "冰球",
 "I started playing club hockey at six and never really stopped. More than a decade later, I still get out to rip pucks whenever I can. I've done plenty of coaching too, both privately and as a volunteer with two U11 teams at Knights Hockey Club through high school, which turned out to be great practice at explaining things clearly and adjusting on the fly.": "我六岁开始打俱乐部冰球，之后就再也没停过。十多年过去了，只要有机会我还是会去场上射门。我也做过不少教练工作，既有私人教学，也在高中期间以志愿者身份执教 Knights 冰球俱乐部的两支 U11 队伍，这让我很好地练习了如何清晰地讲解，以及如何随机应变。",
