 "Calgary Food Bank: CANstruction": "卡尔加里食物银行：CANstruction",
 "CANstruction Calgary · 2024 &amp; 2025": "CANstruction 卡尔加里 · 2024 与 2025",
 "I competed in the <strong>2024 and 2025</strong> CANstruction events for the Calgary Food Bank, designing and building structures made entirely from donated cans alongside engineers from <strong>Fluor Corporation</strong>.": "我参加了卡尔加里食物银行 <strong>2024 年和 2025 年</strong>的 CANstruction 活动，与 <strong>Fluor 公司</strong>的工程师一起设计并搭建完全由捐赠罐头组成的结构。",
 "Every can is donated to the food bank once the competition ends. Photos from both years are in the Projects section above.": "比赛结束后，每一个罐头都会捐给食物银行。两年的照片都在上方的“项目”部分。",
 "Coaching: Knights Hockey": "执教：Knights 冰球",
 "Knights Hockey · U11 Volunteer Coach": "Knights 冰球 · U11 志愿教练",
 "I was a volunteer coach for the <strong>U11 Division 1 and 2 White Knights Hockey Club</strong> teams in the 2023/2024 and 2024/2025 seasons. I ran on-ice practices, gave players feedback during games, and helped them develop their skating, puck handling, and game sense.": "在 2023/2024 和 2024/2025 两个赛季，我担任 <strong>White Knights 冰球俱乐部 U11 一级和二级</strong>队伍的志愿教练。我负责冰上训练，在比赛中给球员反馈，并帮助他们提高滑冰、控球和比赛意识。",
 "Coaching kids at that age is a good reminder that explaining something clearly matters just as much as knowing it.": "执教这个年龄的孩子时常提醒我：能把事情讲清楚，和懂得这件事同样重要。",
 "Undergraduate Scholarships and Awards Committee": "本科奖学金与奖项委员会",
 "Faculty of Engineering, University of Toronto · Student Representative": "多伦多大学工程学院 · 学生代表",
 "I served as the student representative on the Faculty of Engineering's Undergraduate Scholarships and Awards Committee, sitting alongside faculty and staff to review applications and help decide how scholarship funding is allocated.": "我曾担任工程学院本科奖学金与奖项委员会的学生代表，与教职员工一起评审申请，并参与决定奖学金的分配方式。",
 "It gave me a look behind the scenes at how scholarships are actually awarded: the criteria the committee weighs, how funding is spread across a large pool of applicants, and where the student voice is meant to carry weight.": "这让我得以了解奖学金实际评定的幕后过程：委员会权衡哪些标准，资金如何在庞大的申请者群体中分配，以及学生的声音应在哪些方面发挥作用。",
 "Reviewing applications also meant assessing people's achievements in a professional setting, reading through academic records, extracurricular involvement, and personal statements, and weighing them against one another fairly and consistently.": "评审申请也意味着要在专业场合中评估他人的成就：审阅学业成绩、课外活动经历和个人陈述，并公平、一致地进行比较与权衡。",
