 "Two days here for the Ontario Engineering Competition in 2026, one building and one presenting, representing the University of Toronto after winning the Junior Design category at the University of Toronto Engineering Kompetitions. Walked Parliament Hill between rounds, and the Gothic Revival stonework there is the best architecture I’ve seen in Canada.": "2026 年在这里待了两天参加安大略工程竞赛，一天制作、一天展示，在多伦多大学工程竞赛中赢得初级设计组冠军后代表多伦多大学出赛。比赛间隙我逛了国会山，那里的哥特复兴式石砌建筑是我在加拿大见过的最美的建筑。",
